# Back to the book, from the list of paragraphs to mark, goes back to the
# book: the controls are put away and the page key turns the page.
wait-for River
tap River
wait-for Marker 1
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 1 of
tap-id reader-marking
wait-for Tap a paragraph to mark it
tap Marker 2
wait-for Marked: Marker 2
tap Back to the book
wait-idle
expect-missing Page 1 of
page next
expect-missing reading marker 1.
shot books-turned-after-marking
# A tap on the side of the page turns it too.
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing reading marker 4.
